  cal-20261002-s3-060,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I still be running firstmate crewmates daily on 31 December?,I gave 22% that capping the fleet at two produces more.,invest in firstmate's tooling now,plan a wind-down,synthesis,76,68,74,72,80,explore,"Resolved by notes or commits from crewmates in the last week of December 2026: true if crewmate work lands on most days.",2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-061,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Is building the WebMCP safety-evaluation harness worth more of my next ten agent-hours than registering the origin-trial token?,"Both passed: harness 97%, token 90%.",build the harness first,register the token first,synthesis,74,72,76,70,76,exploit,"Resolved by whichever lands first in a later note or commit: true if the harness.",2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-062,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would r/StructuralEngineering give more useful replies to one hand-calculation question than the Eng-Tips forums?,The forum post is due 9 October; no forum is named.,post on r/StructuralEngineering,post on Eng-Tips,synthesis,72,70,80,66,80,explore,"Resolved from the note recording the post: true if it was posted on r/StructuralEngineering.",2026-10-09,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-063,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Is the information-cohomology afternoon one of the five todos I would bet on doing in October?,November is for étale cohomology; I gave 88% to doing it before November.,keep it in my five,park it until December,calibration,72,75,65,72,84,exploit,Resolved true if a note dated in October 2026 records the information-cohomology afternoon; false otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-064,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Is the garbling of my pasted sessions introduced by the paste into the chat rather than by Calibrator's Copy TOON?,Both exports arrived as UTF-8 read as Latin-1; I chose to keep copying text.,fix the paste path into the crewmate,fix Calibrator's Copy TOON encoding,project,78,66,82,64,78,explore,Resolved true if a test shows Copy TOON's clipboard text is valid UTF-8 and the garbling appears only after pasting; false if Copy TOON already garbles it.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-065,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I write a noncommutative-geometry note before 31 October?,"Re-ask as a forecast: 3% that I have already dropped it in practice.",keep NCG off the stop list,put NCG on the stop list,calibration,74,66,72,80,74,explore,Resolved true if a note dated by 2026-10-31 carries #noncommutative-geometry; false otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-066,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Is removing the CLAUDE.md shims one of the five todos I would bet on finishing by 2 November?,Skill discovery may break in at least one repository (87%).,keep it in my five,hand it to a crewmate,calibration,72,75,65,72,82,exploit,Resolved true if by 2026-11-02 the shims are gone from my repositories that have an AGENTS.md; false otherwise.,2026-11-02,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-067,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I spend more than three hours on FPL between 7 and 10 October?,The wildcard is chosen in the last 72 hours; FPL notes only for deadline decisions.,cap the wildcard work at three hours,leave it open,synthesis,70,72,72,70,80,exploit,"Resolved by a later note on the wildcard: true if it records more than three hours.",2026-10-10,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-068,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would picking my todos through cards in each session be quicker than choosing them in a note myself?,This session carries the first todo-picking cards.,keep todo-picking cards in every session,pick todos in a note myself,synthesis,74,66,76,68,80,exploit,Resolved by my answer in session 4 or a note on how I picked todos; unresolved otherwise.,next session,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-069,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Are the generator's top 25 the questions I care most about?,Ranking is fixed before import.,keep ranking by generator scores,let me star five cards to move up next time,synthesis,74,62,80,74,74,explore,Resolved by my answer in session 4; unresolved otherwise.,next session,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-070,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Is recording the gym-bag experiment's outcome one of the five todos I would bet on finishing this week?,Open since session 1; I gave 88% that both sessions happened.,keep it in my five,close it as dropped,calibration,70,75,65,70,84,exploit,Resolved true if a note by 2026-10-09 records the gym-bag outcome; false otherwise.,2026-10-09,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-071,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Is my October agent spend on track to exceed September's?,50 commits on 1 October; no spend figure is in my notes.,set a monthly spend cap now,keep spending,synthesis,72,68,76,72,74,explore,"Resolved by a note comparing October and September agent spend: true if October's is higher.",2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-072,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would ranking the next session by the information-gain visual pick a better top 25 than the generator's scores?,The generator ranks by its own scores; I built the visual.,rank session 4 with the visual,keep the generator's ranking,synthesis,74,62,84,70,72,explore,Resolved by comparing session 4's answers if both rankings are recorded; unresolved otherwise.,next session,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-073,cal-2026-10-02-s3,"Will generating, recording and noting each session cost me more than an hour of attention a week?",Weekly cadence passed at 94%.,move to two sessions a fortnight with one recording,keep weekly,synthesis,72,64,78,72,74,explore,Resolved by a later note estimating the weekly attention cost; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-074,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would one page listing my effective variables with their evidence make me use them in decisions?,"Two candidates exist, each in its own note.",make an effective-variables page,keep them as notes,synthesis,74,62,78,70,76,explore,Resolved by a later note citing an effective variable as the reason for a decision; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-075,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Are the High and Low lines too terse to tell which side applies at a glance?,Two answers flipped by more than 75 points within eight seconds.,write actions as full sentences,keep them short,calibration,74,62,76,70,76,exploit,Resolved by my answer; a later session can compare revision rates.,next session,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-076,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I spend more than 20 hours supervising agents this week?,I answer firstmate's decisions as alerts arrive.,set a weekly supervision budget,keep it open,synthesis,70,66,74,72,74,explore,Resolved by a note estimating this week's supervision hours; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-09,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-077,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Should the site have a status feed separate from notes?,"Re-ask: session 1's card had swapped actions; 18% read either way.",build a status feed,treat notes as the microblog,calibration,74,62,78,72,70,explore,Resolved true if a status feed separate from notes ships on the site by 2026-12-31; false otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-078,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I open the Open questions page at least once a week in October?,Todos live there and in notes; a calendar todo is open.,keep todos on it,move act-now todos to the calendar only,synthesis,70,66,74,70,74,explore,Resolved by my answer in a later session; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-079,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I open any of the visualisations ported to the site this week again before 31 October?,89% that porting at this pace is the best use of agent-hours.,keep porting at this pace,pause porting for a week,calibration,70,64,72,74,74,explore,Resolved by a note dated by 2026-10-31 recording use of a visualisation ported between 2026-09-28 and 2026-10-02; false if none.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-080,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would a desk-only rule make me skip a weekly session?,94% that answering the top 25 at a desk changes my answers.,allow the bottom 75 on a phone,answer all 100 at a desk,synthesis,72,62,74,70,76,exploit,Resolved by my answer in session 4 and whether a week is skipped; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-16,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-081,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would a monthly Brier score of my resolved answers change how I answer?,No answer has resolved yet in raw.toon.,add a monthly Brier-score note,leave scoring to raw.toon,calibration,74,60,78,66,76,explore,Resolved by my answer after the first Brier-score note; unresolved until one exists.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-082,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I use any of the token-reduction tools I listed during October?,"Re-ask as a forecast: 100% that deleting them would lose me something.",keep them,delete the ones unused by 31 October,calibration,70,66,70,72,74,explore,Resolved true if a note or commit in October 2026 records using one; false otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-083,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would the bandit visual need a new input mode before it could allocate my week's hours?,It takes success and failure counts per variant.,ask a crewmate for an hours-allocation mode,use it as it is,project,70,70,76,64,72,explore,"Resolved by the note recording next week's allocation: true if it says the visual needed a new mode.",2026-10-11,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-084,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would one source line on each card make my answers more accurate?,Cards show no links or sources while answering.,allow one source line per card,keep cards free of sources,synthesis,72,56,80,76,70,explore,Resolved by comparing resolved answers from cards with and without a source line once ten of each exist; unresolved until then.,2027-03-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-085,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I re-read a note older than a month to make a decision in October?,The notes page says I revisit older entries.,keep the archive as it is,add a monthly 'revisit three old notes' step,notes,70,62,76,70,74,explore,Resolved by a note in October citing an older note as a reason for a decision; false otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-086,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would a validate.py check that rejects undated #todo notes catch one in October?,92% that every todo needs a date and a done-condition.,add the check to validate.py,keep it a playbook convention,synthesis,70,66,76,62,74,exploit,Resolved true if an undated #todo note is added in October 2026; false otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-087,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would explaining one étale-cohomology result to a person beat writing a note on it?,Every mathematics note I write is for myself.,find one listener in November,keep writing notes,synthesis,70,60,80,66,72,explore,Resolved by a November note comparing the two; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-088,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I search my own calibration history on the site before session 4?,205 calibration records are now in the corpus and search.,keep calibration records in global search,keep them only in raw.toon and corpus.json,project,70,62,76,66,72,explore,"Resolved by my answer in session 4, or a note recording such a search; unresolved otherwise.",next session,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-089,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Is putting my act-now todos in a calendar today one of the five todos I would bet on doing?,Endorsed at 92%; it is the smallest open todo.,keep it in my five,drop it,calibration,70,70,60,65,82,exploit,Resolved true if a note by 2026-10-09 says the act-now todos are in a calendar; false otherwise.,2026-10-09,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-090,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would a podcast episode made from my #calibrator notes make me act on more of them?,The site already turns notes into podcast episodes.,make one Calibrator episode this month,keep the notes as text,project,68,62,78,66,70,explore,Resolved by a later note comparing action on notes with and without the episode; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-091,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would a #parked tag with a date in the text do everything a third closing state would?,88% to a 'parked until <date>' state for items such as option pricing.,add a #parked tag,"add a 'Parked:' closing-note state",synthesis,70,64,76,60,72,exploit,"Resolved by whichever convention lands in the notes playbook: true if a tag.",2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-092,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Is the notes page now too long to read comfortably on a phone?,27 notes were added today alone.,paginate notes by month,keep one page,project,66,62,76,66,70,explore,Resolved true if a later note or commit paginates the notes page; unresolved otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-093,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will any of my 61 public repositories get a star or an issue from someone else by 31 December?,All have 0 stars; most mirror one visualisation.,keep investing in standalone repositories,fold them back into the visuals repository,synthesis,66,58,74,70,68,explore,Resolved true if any yujieteo repository has an outside star or issue by 2026-12-31; false otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-094,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would a visitor notice that my 55 visualisations do not share one design?,Most were ported from their own repositories.,ask a crewmate for one style guide across them,leave the designs as they are,project,66,58,72,70,68,explore,Resolved by a later note on visual consistency; unresolved otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-095,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would a crewmate's draft of the Calibrator blog post save me time without changing what it says?,Posts are where I synthesise.,ask a crewmate for a draft,write it from scratch,synthesis,66,60,72,64,70,explore,"Resolved by the published post's note: true if it started from a crewmate draft.",2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-096,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Would logging a week of meals again change one thing I eat in strength weeks?,My last meal log was on 25 September.,log meals for the week of 5 October,leave meals unlogged,notes,64,60,76,62,70,explore,Resolved true if a meal log for the week of 2026-10-05 appears in notes and a later note names a change; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-18,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-097,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will the dedicated browser E2E repository exist by 31 December?,Each visualisation's own repository stands in until it does.,keep the stand-ins until then,drop the plan and keep E2E in each repository,project,66,60,72,62,70,explore,Resolved true if a public yujieteo E2E test repository exists by 2026-12-31; false otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-098,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I retire any visualisation from the catalogue by 31 December?,55 visualisations; none has ever been retired.,set a retirement rule now,keep every visualisation,project,66,60,70,64,68,explore,Resolved true if a catalogue entry is removed by 2026-12-31; false otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-099,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I run the Mac agent-workstation skill on a real machine by 31 December?,It merged today as PR 15.,keep it maintained,archive it,project,64,58,70,66,66,explore,Resolved true if a note by 2026-12-31 records a run on a real machine; false otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s3-100,cal-2026-10-02-s3,Will I run the grilling skill on a real decision before 31 October?,Its compaction amendment merged today.,keep it,archive it,project,64,58,68,66,66,explore,Resolved true if a note by 2026-10-31 records a grilling session on a real decision; false otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T07:05:00Z"
